ws diffuse cystic change and dense grey white fibrous tissue with no discrete nodules or other gross abnormalities  A silver metal clip is located within the fibrous tissue  Representative sections are submitted from medial to lateral as A J  The tissue adjacent to the silver metal clip is submitted in H  Gross Description by  STEPHANIE KUEHN Resident  STEWART M  KNOEPP  MD   Ph D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Kevin S  Hughes  M D  PART   BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unknown.
