VESSEL INVASION  Present  BLOOD VESSEL INVASION  Suspicious  MARGIN OF INVASIVE CARCINOMA  Invasive carcinoma extends to 0 1cm from the posterior margin of the specimen in one focus  LOCATION OF DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  Within and beyond the region of the mass  GRADE OF DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  2  MARGIN OF DUCTAL CARCINOMA IN SITU  The distances to all margins measure 0 2cm or greater  STAINS FOR RECEPTORS  Requested on block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   BREAST  RIGHT   MAMMOPLASTY  BREAST PARENCHYMA AND SKIN WITH NO EVIDENCE OF CARCINOMA  GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  and  left sentinel lymph node bx hot and blue   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm candidate lymph node  with attached fibroadipose tissue  The lymph node is bisected and submitted entirely for frozen section as FX 1  now as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   The remaining tissue is submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN    left breast   is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 7 0cm simple mastectomy with a short stitch designating superior and a long stitch designating lateral  The anterior surface is inked blue and the posterior surface is inked black  There is an attached ellipse of tan pink skin along the anterior surface measuring REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm  The skin ellipse contains nipple areola complex measuring REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm  The nipple appears to be inverted and measures 1 2cm in greatest dimension  The skin surface also shows a linear healed scar extending from the medial end of the areola to the medial margin of the skin ellipse  The specimen is serially sectioned  The upper central breast parenchyma shows an irregularly outlined  tan pink to gray white  firm to hard tumor measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 1cm  The tumor occupies the upper inner and the upper outer quadrant and is 0 9cm from the posterior inked margin  The breast parenchyma also shows another  irregularly outlined  gray white  firm nodule measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm and located 1 3cm medial and inferior to the tumor  The breast parenchyma shows another gray white firm nodule with irregular borders measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm and located 1 2cm lateral and anterior to the tumor  The breast parenchyma of the lower outer quadrant at approximately 4 o clock position shows another ill defined gray white firm nodule measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  The cut surfaces of this nodule show fibrosis  Obvious fibroadenoma is not appreciated  The remaining breast parenchyma consists of admixed fatty tissue and dense pink white fibrous stroma which show several blue domed cysts measuring from REMOVED_DATE up to 0 7cm in greatest dimension  Obvious lymph nodes are not identified  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Tumor  upper central breast  involving upper outer and upper inner quadrants   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma with entire nodule medial and inferior to the tumor   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma with entire gray white firm nodule lateral and anterior to the tumor   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Gray white firm area at approximately 4 o clock position  lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Breast parenchyma with fibrosis and cysts  away from the tumor  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   Bergart  REMOVE_MRN    right breast tissue   is a 51 g  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 8cm aggregate of tan red fibrofatty tissue partially surfaced by irregular strips of tan pink skin ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 10 5cm in greatest dimension  Sectioning reveals unremarkable fibrofatty tissue  and representative sections are submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION   1   LEFT SENTINEL NODE   CARCINOMA IS NOT IDENTIFIED  AWAIT SENTINEL NODE WORKUP  Final Diagnosis by David C Wilbur